<TITLE>Cases</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>High rigidity is ensured by optimum placement of ribs and case shapes using FEM analysis, suppressing deformation due to loads from the gear train.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>An aluminum alloy case and cover have been adopted to reduce weight.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The shape and rib arrangement have been designed to reduce vibration in the range where gear noise occurs, while minimizing any weight increase.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
